  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Program for Strengthening the Preinvestment Cycle</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa para el Fortalecimiento del Ciclo de Preinverisn</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general del programa es apoyar al Gobierno de Ecuador (GdE) a reducir la brecha entre lo programado y lo ejecutado del Plan Anual de Inversiones (PAI). El objetivo especfico del programa es apoyar al Instituto Nacional de Preinversin (INP) en aumentar el porcentaje de proyectos que cuente con estudios de preinversin que demuestren su viabilidad tcnica y econmica. Para el efecto, se propone un monto de US$40 millones para financiar los estudios generales y especficos de preinversin durante los prximos tres aos, de forma de alcanzar una masa crtica de proyectos que puedan ser incluidos en el PAI.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programs general objective is to support the Government of Ecuador in reducing the gap in the Annual Investment Plan (AIP) between what is planned and what is executed. The programs specific objective is to support the National Preinvestment Institute (INP) in increasing the percentage of projects that conduct preinvestment studies to demonstrate their technical and economic viability. To this end, an amount of US$40 million is proposed to finance general and specific preinvestment studies during the next three years, in an attempt to achieve a critical mass of projects that can be included in the AIP.</narrative>
  </description>
